只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin: a /! command trigger (run one command, analyze output, inspired by Claude Code's ! gesture) and a /terminal command (interactive PTY popup with on-demand history reference).","id":"gh:1336120084","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-shell-command","slug":"CHplus0/dsh-shell-command","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin: a /! command trigger (run one command, analyze output, inspired by Cl"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"aude Code's ! gesture) and a /terminal command (interactive PTY popup with on-demand history referen"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" Code's ! gesture) and a /terminal command (interactive PTY popup with on-demand history reference)."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-shell-command"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin that brings Claude Code's `!` gesture to DSH, split into two modes:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Command | Behavior |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| `/! <command>` | Run a shell command, analyze its output. Inspired by Claude Code's `!` prefix — r"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"uns the command in the session workspace and delivers the output to the model for immediate analysis"},{"id":"p6s3","text":". |\n| `/terminal` | Open an interactive terminal popup. Closing never sends anything to the model — "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"if the session received input, the transcript persists and the panel jumps to a history tab (new ent"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ry pre-selected) where you can reference it into the model on demand. |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Note**: DSH's input trigger system only supports `/` and `@` as trigger characters, so we use `/!`"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" instead of a bare `!` prefix."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Requires the `dsh` CLI and Node `>= 22`."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Restart the web surface once (`dsh web`) so the host-side command loads. It appears in the input `/`"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" menu automatically."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Your first `/!` command"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Type in the input box:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The command runs immediately, and the output is delivered to the model for analysis. You'll see a me"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" runs immediately, and the output is delivered to the model for analysis. You'll see a message like:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> **Shell Command Output**\n> Command: `df -h`\n> [output here]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The model then analyzes the disk usage and may suggest actions if issues are found."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Your first `/terminal` session"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"1. Type `/terminal` in the input box\n2. A floating terminal panel opens with two tabs: **会话** (Sessi"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"on) and **历史** (History)\n3. In the Session tab, try some commands:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"4. Click **退出** (Exit) in the header to close the terminal\n5. The panel stays open and automatically"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" jumps to the **History** tab\n6. Your just-closed session is pre-selected and expanded\n7. Choose wha"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"t to do:\n- Click **引用并分析** to send it to the model for analysis\n- Click **直接退出，本次不分析** to skip and c"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"ck **引用并分析** to send it to the model for analysis\n- Click **直接退出，本次不分析** to skip and close the panel"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Command Details"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### `/! <command>` — Single-command analysis"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Runs the command in your session workspace and immediately delivers the output to the model for anal"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ysis. This is the DSH equivalent of Claude Code's `!` prefix."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**When to use:**\n- Quick status checks: `/! git status`, `/! npm test`\n- System diagnostics: `/! df "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"-h`, `/! free -h`, `/! top -bn1 | head -20`\n- File searches: `/! find . -name \"*.log\" -mtime -1`\n- O"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ne-off operations where you want immediate AI insight"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**Examples:**"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"**Technical details:**\n- Output is bounded (`maxOutputBytes`, tail retained) and formatted for analy"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"sis\n- The command text and lifecycle are logged to the trajectory (`command/run`/`command/done`)\n- R"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"equires an active model conversation (won't work on the first message before any model request)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### `/terminal` — Interactive terminal"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"An interactive PTY popup (persistent shell, live WebSocket stream). Best for:\n- **Exploratory debugg"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ing**: run multiple commands, observe behavior\n- **Iterative testing**: modify → test → modify cycle"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"s\n- **Multi-step operations**: setup → execute → verify workflows"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**How it works:**"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Closing the terminal **never** sends anything to the model automatically:\n- If the session never rec"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"eived input → no trace left (no file, no history entry)\n- If the session received input → transcript"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" persists to `<workspace>/.dsh-shell-transcripts/`, panel jumps to History tab with the new entry pr"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"to `<workspace>/.dsh-shell-transcripts/`, panel jumps to History tab with the new entry pre-selected"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"You decide later whether to reference it for analysis (see History Tab workflow below)."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"#### Session Tab Features"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- **Line-oriented terminal**: monospace scrollback + input line\n- **Control keys**: Ctrl+C/D/Z send "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"raw control bytes to the shell\n- **Command history**: ArrowUp/ArrowDown recall previously-submitted "},{"id":"p36s3","text":"lines (client-side, max 500 entries)\n- **Limitations**: Tab-completion not supported; full VT100/xte"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"rm (vim, htop) planned for future release"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"#### History Tab Workflow"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"When you close a terminal session that received input, the panel automatically switches to the Histo"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"u close a terminal session that received input, the panel automatically switches to the History tab:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"**UI Elements:**\n1. **Checkbox** (left): Select one or more history entries for analysis\n2. **Timest"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"amp**: When each session was closed\n3. **View/Collapse button** (right): Expand to preview the trans"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"cript\n4. **Notes textarea** (bottom): Optional natural-language context for the model\n5. **Default m"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"essage hint**: Shows what the model receives if you leave notes empty: \"请帮我分别分析这些历史终端记录。\"\n6. **Two a"},{"id":"p39s5","text":"ction buttons**:\n- **引用并分析** (\"Reference & Analyze\"): Send selected entries to the model for immedia"},{"id":"p39s6","text":"te analysis\n- **直接退出，本次不分析** (\"Exit without analyzing\"): Close the panel without sending anything"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"**Typical workflow:**"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Advanced usage:**\n- **Compare across runs**: Select 2-3 related sessions (e.g., before/after a fix"},{"id":"p42s2","text":") and ask: \"What changed between these attempts?\"\n- **Guided analysis**: Use the notes field to dire"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"ct the model's attention: \"Focus on memory usage patterns\"\n- **Selective sharing**: Not every termin"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"al session needs analysis — only reference what's relevant"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"**Storage:**\n- Transcripts persist to `<workspace>/.dsh-shell-transcripts/`\n- Each session gets: `<s"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"essionId>-<timestamp>-<counter>.log` + `.meta.json` sidecar\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- The `/!` output is delivered as a plugin-sourced message (visible in the conversation)\n- Terminal "},{"id":"p45s2","text":"mode: line-oriented display only (vim/htop require full xterm emulation, planned for a future releas"},{"id":"p45s3","text":"e)\n- API surface targets `@deepseek-ai/dsh` `0.1.0-rc.x`; pin peers and re-verify on DSH upgrades"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
